OL,3,AFive takeaways from Canada's push to
OL,4,Awoo the world's richest investors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has pledged to bring
OL,7,Fin C$1tn ($720bn; #530bn) in
OL,8,Finvestments in the b@Lnext bA five
OL,9,Fyears as he seeks to reduce Canada's
OL,10,Freliance on the US, and the summit he
OL,11,Fconvened this week is a test of whether
OL,12,Fhe can deliver on promises to
OL,13,Fstrengthen economic resilience.
OL,15,FThe stakes are high as the trade
OL,16,Fdispute with the US has pushed Canada
OL,17,Fto seek deeper economic partnerships
OL,18,Fwith Europe, Asia and the Middle East.
